{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqfatdr2s67","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"OVERRIDE: claim gate still blocks background workers — task 20 fix is done-but-unmerged AND targets the wrong gate path","summary":"SPEC IS INCOMPLETE: the orch gate STILL refuses legit run_in_background Agent-tool worker claims as of 2026-06-15, despite task 091a4bf1/20 (\"Fix touchAgent dropping agent_tool_spawn\") being marked done. Two independent reasons, both verified this session.\n\n(1) NEVER LANDED. Task 20's branch orch/attempt/091a4bf1-...-20 is still leased:true (unmerged). Its own summary flags that the prerequisite arm-(b) overlay precondition (routes/overlay.js) + agentToolSpawn detection (routes/exec.js) were UNCOMMITTED in the main working tree and absent from the branch base — part of the dormant audit-sprint tree (still uncommitted, daemon never restarted onto it). The live daemon runs the old code.\n\n(2) WRONG GATE PATH. Task 20 patched the /overlay/status claim gate (routes/overlay.js arm (b): a.agent_tool_spawn && a.agent_id===b.agent_id). But the shell hook hooks/orch-gate.sh that blocks inline Edit/Write NEVER calls /overlay/status — it calls /active-claim and /session-info (routes/session.js). Those two endpoints have NO worktree-backed hookless-worker fallback. They reconcile a background worker only via agents[agent_id].subagent_session (session.js:25,33,54-59), which is never populated for run_in_background spawns because the SubagentStart hook does not fire for them.\n\nROOT MECHANISM of the live failure: a run_in_background worker inherits no SubagentStart, so it knows only the PARENT env CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID and registers its start_task claim under that parent id with subagent_session=null. The gate, invoked inside the worker's Edit, is handed the worker's OWN distinct hook session id (SUB != parent). /active-claim?session=SUB finds no claim (claim is under parent, bridges need subagent_session=SUB), /session-info?session=SUB returns is_subagent:false, so the gate concludes main/dispatcher and denies with \"no in-flight workers\". Also note task 20's overlay fix keys on agent_tool_spawn===true, which our start_task path never sets (no parent_session_id passed) — so even i","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-15T14:18:30.494Z","vec":[-0.1074354350566864,0.02551412582397461,-0.0015278899809345603,0.009957178495824337,0.10067286342382431,-0.06883128732442856,-0.0005567471962422132,0.0022611874155700207,0.014070478267967701,0.07937826216220856,0.016314754262566566,0.0021850818302482367,0.012958011589944363,0.010797194205224514,0.014198614284396172,0.036518123000860214,0.02681226097047329,-0.0233842134475708,-0.03019648976624012,-0.043066490441560745,0.034644223749637604,0.03048062138259411,0.0410524345934391,0.010241510346531868,-0.043936822563409805,-0.06493324786424637,-0.0809352844953537,-0.032224997878074646,-0.019619304686784744,-0.034464236348867416,-0.014672283083200455,0.08852226287126541,-0.09239214658737183,-0.06389632821083069,0.06728333234786987,0.09320323914289474,0.020123207941651344,0.00575294392183423,-0.022859476506710052,0.0046972366981208324,0.05881568789482117,0.06400469690561295,-0.038488827645778656,-0.0816367119550705,-0.08386529237031937,-0.02015441656112671,-0.03612567111849785,-0.0402839332818985,-0.03467784821987152,-0.008835128508508205,0.04174064099788666,-0.004843887407332659,0.1010359451174736,0.06435553729534149,0.011392572894692421,0.015085894614458084,0.02988218143582344,0.029010476544499397,-0.0013164120027795434,0.04181213304400444,0.03105435147881508,0.024666018784046173,-0.04000833258032799,-0.036210983991622925,0.010687204077839851,0.04734417051076889,-0.0037476487923413515,-0.05823853239417076,0.016312668099999428,-0.056274089962244034,0.0322222001850605,-0.01727285422384739,-0.07331737875938416,-0.045201387256383896,0.018471837043762207,0.009308712556958199,0.013573013246059418,0.052405040711164474,-0.01249172817915678,-0.20928290486335754,-0.09944318234920